Browser speech components

text-runtime.js bundles Transformers.js 4.3.1 (Apache-2.0), ONNX Runtime
Web 1.30.0 (MIT), Tokenizers.js 0.2.0 (Apache-2.0) and Jinja 0.5.10 (MIT),
with the Qwen3 model registration. Their licenses accompany this distribution.
Qwen3-0.6B model: Qwen Team, Alibaba Cloud, Apache-2.0. See qwen-LICENSE.
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B
ONNX conversion: https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/Qwen3-0.6B-ONNX
Snapshot: 1e0a4a196ecabdf9a879664110574563d3f372d3

runtime.js includes Kokoro.js 1.2.1 (hexgrad/Xenova, Apache-2.0),
Transformers.js 4.3.1 (Hugging Face, Apache-2.0), ONNX Runtime Web 1.30.0
(Microsoft, MIT), and phonemizer 1.2.1 (Xenova, Apache-2.0).
Transformers.js is bundled with Kokoro and MusicGen model registrations.
It includes Hugging Face Tokenizers.js 0.2.0 (Apache-2.0) and Jinja 0.5.10
(MIT); their licenses accompany this distribution.
The additional Kokoro phonemization helper comes from
https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro/tree/main/kokoro.js/src
The voice download URL is pinned to the model snapshot listed below.
Individual licenses accompany this distribution. The phonemizer embeds
eSpeak NG (GPL-3.0; see espeak-ng-LICENSE).
Phonemizer source: https://github.com/xenova/phonemizer.js
eSpeak NG source: https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng

chatterbox-runtime.js is a separate, on-demand bundle of Transformers.js
4.3.1 (Apache-2.0), ONNX Runtime Web 1.30.0 (MIT), Tokenizers.js 0.2.0
(Apache-2.0) and Jinja 0.5.10 (MIT), with the Chatterbox model registration.
Their licenses accompany this distribution.
Chatterbox model and default reference voice: Resemble AI / ONNX Community,
MIT. See chatterbox-LICENSE and the model card:
https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/chatterbox-ONNX
Snapshot: 3cab09af388d3f02bba43443fce88c1f4525ac43
https://github.com/resemble-ai/chatterbox

Kokoro model and voice assets: hexgrad / ONNX Community, Apache-2.0.
https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX
Model snapshot: 1939ad2a8e416c0acfeecc08a694d14ef25f2231
Kokoro blend presets mix the two named Apache-2.0 voice tables in equal
proportions. They are voice combinations, not additional trained models.

MusicGen Small model: Meta, CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial).
ONNX conversion: Xenova, https://huggingface.co/Xenova/musicgen-small
Snapshot: 6a8096dabfff72909ef5eae41461408e29ae20fd
https://huggingface.co/facebook/musicgen-small

Kitten 0.8 voice tables are float32 conversions of KittenML's voices.npz
files, without modifying the values. Models and voice assets: Apache-2.0.
https://github.com/KittenML/KittenTTS
Model repositories and revisions are recorded in kitten-models.json.

supertonic.js is adapted from Supertone's MIT-licensed browser helper:
https://github.com/supertone-oss-archive/supertonic/blob/main/web/helper.js
Local adaptations select the shared runtime, cache model requests, reuse
denoising tensors, report download progress, and release temporary tensors
and failed session loads.
Supertonic 3 weights: BigScience Open RAIL-M (see supertonic-model-LICENSE).
https://huggingface.co/supertone-oss-archive/supertonic-3
Snapshot: aafc6e32416a594460b32413efc49d7fe4ce6d46

